Package: taxonAlign.dataprep
Title: Build and Release Taxonomic References for taxonAlign
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Elizabeth", family = "Wenk", role = c("aut", "ctb", "cph"), email = "e.wenk@unsw.edu.au", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5640-5910")),
    person(given = "Fonti", family = "Kar", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "f.kar@unsw.edu.au", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2760-3974"))
    )
Description: Companion to taxonAlign. Turns taxonomic references into the
  format taxonAlign matches names against: reshapes the Australian National Species
  List and Australian Faunal Directory exports and the Australian Plant Census, builds
  references from the GBIF backbone (live, or from taxadb's snapshots), and walks users
  through mapping their own reference tables onto the format interactively. Also builds
  the versioned data releases that taxonAlign::load_taxonomic_resources() downloads.
